{"id": "en_hurricane_p1", "total": 71.75, "segments": [{"text": "If a hurricane approaches your beach, do not worry about howling wind first.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.16}, {"text": "Water from storm surge causes most hurricane deaths, and Jake has 10 minutes left.", "start": 3.62, "end": 7.22}, {"text": "Panicked crowds scramble off the sand as dark dusk skies unleash ferocious breaking swells.", "start": 8.023, "end": 11.84}, {"text": "One. If officials say evacuate, go immediately because rising surge drowns entire coastal zones.", "start": 12.26, "end": 16.94}, {"text": "Jake remembers the golden rule to run from water and hide from wind.", "start": 17.56, "end": 20.32}, {"text": "He chooses to walk to shelter toward a massive 10-floor concrete hotel nearby.", "start": 20.68, "end": 23.92}, {"text": "Two. Leave dangerous surge zones fast and seek shelter inside a sturdy reinforced building.", "start": 24.7, "end": 29.0}, {"text": "Jake hurries across the empty lobby and moves upstairs away from the ground.", "start": 29.0, "end": 32.46}, {"text": "Three. Stay far away from exterior windows and lock yourself inside an interior room.", "start": 33.02, "end": 37.16}, {"text": "He enters an interior hallway room with thick walls and closes the heavy door.", "start": 37.64, "end": 40.82}, {"text": "Outside, the violent ocean surge slams onto the beach and swallows the lower floors.", "start": 41.46, "end": 45.32}, {"text": "Steel reinforced concrete holds firm against the punishing waves crashing below his high sanctuary.", "start": 45.92, "end": 49.9}, {"text": "Down below, exploding transformers illuminate the dark sky and power lines plunge into water.", "start": 50.6, "end": 55.08}, {"text": "He followed every single evacuation rule, securing himself safely above the raging ocean flood.", "start": 55.08, "end": 59.76}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan, but there was suddenly just one terrifying new problem.", "start": 60.32, "end": 64.0}, {"text": "Black water be